  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about work",
     "texto": [
      "**Ansatt** means «employee»; **leder**, «manager» or «boss». **Arbeidstid** is the working hours and **lønn** is the salary.",
      "A job can be **heltid** (full-time) or **deltid** (part-time). **Dagvakt** is the day shift; **nattevakt**, the night shift."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Tasks and responsibility",
     "texto": [
      "**Arbeidsoppgave** means work task. **Ansvar for** expresses that someone takes charge of something: **Hun har ansvar for gjestene** («She is responsible for the guests»). **Tar imot** means to receive or welcome."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
